    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DAYTIME, EVENING AND WEEKEND VIEWINGS AVAILABLE | PLEASE CALL US TO ARRANG AN APPOINTMENT\r\n\r\nLambay Properties are truly delighted to present No. 119 St. Werburgh’s to the market. This spectacular three-bedroom, two-bathroom penthouse residence in Turn-Key condition,  is an impressive conversation-stopping property, offering an unrivalled blend of grand-scale luxury and lifestyle convenience. Extending to an expansive 177 sq. m. (approx. 1,905 sq. ft.)—excluding a massive 50 sq. m. wrap-around balcony—this home is flooded with natural light and designed to deliver a \"WOW factor\" at every single turn.  \r\n\r\nThe Show-Stopping Space \r\n• The Drawing Room (67 sq. m.): A magnificent, light-filled entertaining space boasting soaring high ceilings, a cozy solid-fuel wood burner, and dedicated zones large enough to comfortably accommodate a formal dining setup and a Baby Grand Piano. \r\n• Sun-Drenched Wrap-Around Balconies (~50 sq. m.): South- and East-facing outdoor terraces featuring a tranquil water feature, perfect for al fresco dining, entertaining, and taking in panoramic sea and countryside views. \r\n• The Elevated Mezzanine (15 sq. m.): Overlooking the main living space, this versatile area includes a dedicated storage room and floored under-eaves storage. Ideal as a premium home office, reading retreat, or play area. \r\n• The Master Suite (48 sq. m.): A massive, private sanctuary complete with its own luxury walk-in dressing room and a sumptuous ensuite bathroom. \r\n• Upgraded Kitchen: A separate, recently modernised space optimised for both casual and formal dining, packed with premium appliances and smart storage solutions."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Detailed Accommodation Breakdown • \r\nEntrance Hall: 9.92 sq. m. | \"L\" shaped with built-in storage. \r\n• Living / Dining Room: 67.00 sq. m. | Feature wood burner, triple aspect, access to balcony. \r\n• Wrap-Around Balcony: ~50.00 sq. m. | South & East facing. \r\n• Mezzanine: 15.00 sq. m. | Includes walk-in storage room & eaves access. \r\n• Master Bedroom Suite: 48.00 sq. m. | Includes dressing room & his and hers ensuite. \r\n• Bedroom 2: 10.80 sq. m. | Large south-facing double with floor-to-ceiling wardrobes. \r\n• Bedroom 3: 15.12 sq. m. | Large south-facing double with floor-to-ceiling wardrobes. \r\n• Family Bathroom: 11.86 sq. m. | Luxury suite with walk-in shower and separate corner bath. \r\nOverall Floor Area: c. 177 sq. m. / 1,905 sq. ft. (Excluding balconies)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "An Unrivalled Coastal & Village Location The location of St. Werburgh’s is second to none, perfectly straddling vibrant town convenience and coastal charm: • Swords Village & The Pavilions: Just a short, easy walk to excellent restaurants, local boutiques, a cinema complex, and major retail hubs. • Malahide Village & Coast: Minutes away from Malahide Castle, coastal beaches, premium dining, and the Malahide DART/Train station. • Effortless Connectivity: Unbeatable transport links with swift, direct access to Dublin Airport, the M1, and the M50 motorways.  Premium Building Features • Full Lift Access directly servicing the penthouse level. • Generous Communal Parking for residents and guests. • Beautifully Managed Gardens and pristine communal areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C1"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "VIEWING HIGHLY RECOMMENDED\r\n\r\nDAYTIME, EVENING AND WEEKEND VIEWINGS AVAILABLE | PLEASE CALL US TO ARRANG AN APPOINTMENT\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for a show-stopping luxury home to entertain in, or a high-end property to trade down to without sacrificing scale, No. 119 St. Werburgh's delivers an exceptional lifestyle that will leave a lasting impression. Contact Lambay Properties today to arrange your private viewing."
      }
